--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@
 
 A small notes CLI.
 
-- `notes export --format json|csv OUT` writes every note to OUT.
+- `notes export --format json|csv OUT` writes every note to OUT and prints how many it wrote; an unknown format exits with status 2.
 - `notes sync` exports the notes as JSON and pushes them to the sync server.
 
 The default export format comes from `NOTES_FORMAT` (default `json`).
